This kit adapts parts of ego-lite (https://github.com/citrolabs/ego-lite):

- the multi-host plugin layout (one skill packed for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and
  hosts that read the Agent Plugins standard, with a marketplace file per host);
- scripts/build.mjs: the symlink checks and JSON writing from
  plugins/scripts/package-plugins.mjs;
- tests/: the idea of checking that every host manifest carries the same name and
  version, from plugins/ego/tests/.

No ego-lite code that drives a browser is included. ego-lite's license follows.

